{"3906690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Diamond Painting", "steam_appid": 3906690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4825740, 4825750, 4825760], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring Diamond Painting to Life in a Relaxing Creative Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of diamond painting in a calming digital environment. Choose from a variety of beautiful artworks in different sizes, and fill them with colorful dots to complete your masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools inspired by real diamond painting: slice the transparent cover layer with a knife, place dots with a peaker that can hold 1 to 10 pieces and rotate horizontally or vertically, and remove mistakes with a precision tweezer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between round or square-shaped dots and enjoy the tactile satisfaction of each placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of the craft or just looking for a relaxing way to unwind, this game captures the essence of real diamond painting in an intuitive and engaging way.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bring Diamond Painting to Life in a Relaxing Creative Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of diamond painting in a calming digital environment. Choose from a variety of beautiful artworks in different sizes, and fill them with colorful dots to complete your masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools inspired by real diamond painting: slice the transparent cover layer with a knife, place dots with a peaker that can hold 1 to 10 pieces and rotate horizontally or vertically, and remove mistakes with a precision tweezer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between round or square-shaped dots and enjoy the tactile satisfaction of each placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a fan of the craft or just looking for a relaxing way to unwind, this game captures the